{"unit_id":"Seetraum__harness-session-delete#card-card-zh","repo":"Seetraum/harness-session-delete","commit":"3f41dd29221b6a844f9682a835551568a4b49f89","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 会话回收站（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 会话提供可恢复归档和彻底删除管理。它将主机服务挂载到 DSH，并通过客户端接口接入会话详情页与设置面板。用户可以从会话页归档当前会话，在设置中的回收站搜索、预览、恢复或批量永久删除会话，也可查看和选择子会话。适合需要整理历史会话并控制清理范围的 DSH Web 用户。使用需要 DSH Web 环境，不需要额外 API Key；永久删除会清除本机会话日志和缓存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2063-2121","packages/session-trash-host/lib/index.js:1433-1512"]}
{"unit_id":"Seetraum__harness-session-delete#card-card-en","repo":"Seetraum/harness-session-delete","commit":"3f41dd29221b6a844f9682a835551568a4b49f89","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Recycle Bin adds session archiving and a recycle-bin panel to DSH Web. Users can search, preview, restore, and permanently delete sessions, including selected child sessions. It requires no API key; permanent deletion removes local logs and cache records.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2063-2121","packages/session-trash-host/lib/index.js:1433-1512"]}
